    rdf:value """Monday, Mar. 25, 1907
Members Mandions, Victoria St., S.W.
Fine.
Crossed to London 12-7.5. Logan met me here and we dined together.
Bernhard had the Cooks and Thorolds to dine.
Horne called with Acton (!) in the afternoon and Corradini came later."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 106 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1907> .

